#6. Ask the user to enter a password. If its length is greater than 8, Password must contain at least one number (0-9), Password must contain at least one uppercase letter (A-2), Password must contain at least one lowercase letter (a-z), Password must contain at least one special character (@#5%^ &) then print "Strong Password".
password=(input("enter a password:"))
special="@#$%^&"
number=any (char.isdigit() for char in password)
uppercase= any(char.isupper() for char in password)
lowercase= any(char.islower()for char in password)
special_char=any(char in special for char in password)

if len(password)>=8 and number and uppercase and lowercase and special_char:
    print("Strong Password")
else:
    print("Weak Password")


    

